scription","Official World Labs Marble flythrough of a blue-lit diner with booths, a counter, ceiling fixtures and a checkerboard floor","alt","Recording type","Original project recording","role","provenance","Track","3D","track","metadata","Related project",[91],"resourceId",{"_49":92,"_26":93},"World Labs Marble","/resources/marble/","What this recording shows","An official scene flythrough, not a complete game or evidence of authored gameplay systems. Product generation and export have account and plan requirements; collider mesh and high-quality textured GLB export are separate features.","limitations","Demo category","Scene generation","demoType","lead","3d","scenes","source-recording","recordingId","marble","resource:marble","resource","Generates persistent, navigable 3D scenes with splat and mesh exports.","/resources/",{"_20":105,"_180":92,"_178":181,"_47":182,"_179":108,"_174":173,"_26":63,"_57":183,"_155":184,"_150":185,"_146":186,"_140":187,"_137":136},[113,114,115,116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124,125,126],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_47":22,"_51":92,"_53":180,"_55":-7},{"_47":100,"_51":108,"_53":179,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":177,"_51":147,"_53":178,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_49":175,"_51":176,"_53":47,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_49":172,"_51":173,"_53":174,"_55":56},{"_47":57,"_49":169,"_59":170,"_53":26,"_55":-7},{"_47":57,"_49":161,"_59":162,"_53":57,"_55":-7},{"_47":141,"_49":153,"_143":144,"_59":154,"_53":155,"_55":-7},{"_47":141,"_49":148,"_143":144,"_59":149,"_53":150,"_55":-7},{"_47":141,"_49":142,"_143":144,"_59":145,"_53":146,"_55":-7},{"_47":48,"_49":138,"_51":139,"_53":140,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_49":135,"_51":136,"_53":137,"_55":87},{"_47":48,"_53":132,"_49":133,"_51":134},{"_47":57,"_53":127,"_49":128,"_59":129},"identitySource","Identity evidence",[130],{"_49":131,"_26":63},"World Labs","identity","Identity & attribution","The official World Labs product announcement introduces Marble. Use the World Labs brand associated with the product announcement, not a generated scene or a third-party company logo. The SVG is the official site icon linked in https://www.worldlabs.ai/ HTML.","Source reviewed","2026-10-19","verified","Year","2025","year","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[85,147],"dimensions","World models","Development stages",[151,152,147],"stages","Assets & animation","Engines & scenes","Topics",[156,157,158,159,160],"tags","scene-generation","explicit-3d","Gaussian-splatting","mesh-export","hosted","Further reading",[163,164],{"_49":167,"_26":168},{"_49":165,"_26":166},"Web-app mesh export","https://docs.worldlabs.ai/marble/export/mesh","Product","https://marble.worldlabs.ai/","Project source",[171],{"_49":169,"_26":63},"Why it belongs here","Marble supports multimodal world creation, exports Gaussian splats, visual meshes, and collision meshes for approximate physics, and renders video along camera paths. Compared with pure video continuation, it produces spatial assets for downstream engines. Developers still need to build character behavior, quest logic, and game loops. According to the inspected web-app guide, collider mesh export is included with Standard and high-quality textured GLB export requires Pro.","detail","Resource type","Tool","Category","category","summary","name","world","tool",[190,191],[156,157,158,159,160],[188,189,181],[101,181],2025,"assets","scene",{"_49":167,"_26":168},{"_49":165,"_26":166},{"_193":194},"documents",{"_195":196,"_197":198},"en",[200,204,205,206,203,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,202,239,201,240,241,242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257],"zh",[199,200,201,202,203],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-r